    "answer": {
      "short": "$61\\text{ m}^2$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}s&=\\sqrt{2^2+1.5^2}=2.5\\text{ m}\\\\A_{\\text{floor}}&=4\\times3=12\\\\A_{\\text{side walls}}&=2(3\\times2)=12\\\\A_{\\text{ends}}&=2\\left(4\\times2+\\tfrac12\\times4\\times1.5\\right)=22\\\\A_{\\text{roof}}&=2(2.5\\times3)=15\\\\\\text{SA}&=12+12+22+15\\\\\\text{SA}&=61\\text{ m}^2\\end{align*}$$",
